		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Welcome back, Soujin-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, I see you have Kotone-san with you.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ehehee, I've come to visit.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Kotone and I spent all day wandering around Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Did you have a fun date?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed, I had a truly wonderful time!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A lot of people stopped you in the street. Aren't you tired?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Kotone is one of the most famous figures in the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"To the point where everyone, regardless of their nationality, stops to greet her.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am quite all right.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It shows how much everyone trusts us priestesses, so I do not consider it a burden.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If anything, I am motivated to work harder than ever!”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Kotone clenches her fist.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I see... I should've expected no less from Your Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Awawa, I'm terribly sorry for being pretentious!”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Flustered, Kotone hastily returns the manager's elegant bow.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Neither of them makes any move to raise their head first.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Kotone doesn't look like she's going to catch on to the\nmanager's jest, so let's change the subject.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Manager, were you okay running the shop by yourself?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Even now that the war with the Republic is over, I still continue to work at the flower shop.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"The role of the warriors will change with the coming democratization, but until that's been decided, I'm living the same way I was before.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Now, now, Soujin-kun. It's most ungentlemanly for you to be worrying about work on a date with your girlfriend.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Heheheh. Not girlfriend, but wife.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Isn't that right, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"darling?",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, it's still unsettling to hear you call me that.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aww, I was simply trying to express my wifely devotion...”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No need for that. Your love comes across loud and clear.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Kotone shows me an enamored expression.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Very well. I will continue to shower you...”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No! I will endeavor to positively drown you in my love!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Kotone declares emphatically, sidling up next to me.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone...”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"I wrap an arm around Kotone's shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Kotone peers up at me, her cheeks faintly flushed.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Drawn in by her, I bring my lips to─",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“*Cough! Cough, cough!* Ahem!”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin & Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah!” “Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"The manager's coughing fit brings us back to our senses.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"That's right. We were talking about work.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Actually, there's still an outstanding delivery order.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I really do need to get it delivered as soon as possible.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"From the sound of it, it's one of the manager's regulars.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, we'll watch over the shop.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That all right, Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am happy to do anything, so long as it is with you, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Sorry for the trouble, then, but I'll be counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"We see the manager off and stand in front of the store to greet customers.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Ordinarily, the sight of the Exalt-Priestess working as a shop assistant would cause quite the commotion.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"But perhaps because of Kotone's reputation, passersby are only taken aback momentarily before quickly accepting the state of affairs.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Kotone meets the countless bows and handshake requests that come her way without missing a single beat.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've really got it together.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? Whatever might you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Kotone quirks her head in puzzlement.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Apparently she's not even conscious of it.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"I suppose that's just another reason she's the Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Her innocence charms me, and I can't help but break out into a smile.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Mrgh, Soujin-sama, what are you smiling at? I do not appreciate being left out.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, it's nothing. I was just thinking how cute you are.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ohh...”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wh-Whatever are you ever shaying?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Kotone blushes and flubs her words.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Even us getting married hasn't done anything to change how innocent she is.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hmph, see if I care!”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Kotone turns away in a huff.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"But she only gives me the cold shoulder for a few seconds before shyly holding out her hand.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"This is her signal for “I won't forgive you until you hold my hand.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Ehehee.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"When I squeeze back, Kotone's cheeks soften like she's biting into a manjuu.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry. I shouldn't have said that.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Mmrgh, are you truly apologetic?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It always feels like I'm being twisted around your little finger.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Despite what she says, though, Kotone doesn't move to let go of my hand.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"If anything, she happily entwines her fingers even tighter around mine.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"The flow of people around us dies down, leaving the two of us all alone.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, do you remember?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have helped out at the flower shop in the past as well.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh yeah, back during the Persica Blossom Festival, wasn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"I had only just met Kotone back then.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“At the time, I never would have dreamed that we might get married someday.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Actually, forget marriage─I never even thought that I might fall in love with you.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haha, me neither.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I never gave a single thought to the idea of getting married.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How innocent I was back then.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I had no idea how wonderful it could be to fall in love with someone.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Kotone wraps her arms around mine.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"She proceeds to nuzzle her cheek against me like a small animal.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"I'd sweep her up in an embrace right here and now if we\nweren't outside.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thinking back on it makes me feel a bit nostalgic.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We had our fateful meeting here in Tenkyo, and we ran away to Iseya together...”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I proclaimed my feelings for you, and then you...”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Kotone falls silent, a deep blush crossing her face.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"She must be thinking back to that night in Iseya...",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"That night I claimed her chastity.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ehehee... my face is all hot now.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Kotone murmurs, even as she tightens her grip on my arm.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Her soft chest wraps my arm in its embrace as she presses herself tightly against me.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Since that night, Kotone and I haven't lain together even once.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Not that we haven't had the opportunity, but we've simply had so many other things to enjoy.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"After all, the both of us are completely clueless about the ways of love.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Even just going on a stroll through Tenkyo on our occasional days off was more than exciting enough for us.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Um, Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I've studied up on lots of things since then, and─”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, someone's coming.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hweeeh?!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Whatever Kotone was about to say, she cuts off with an abortive squeal, screaming as she flings my arm aside.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"An elderly woman passing in front of the shop reverently lowers her head towards Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Kotone stiffly smiles and returns her bow.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Phew... I allowed someone else to witness me being intimate with Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This simply will not do. As the Exalt-Priestess, I must get ahold of myself.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Kotone smacks herself on the cheeks to steel her resolve.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"But a troubled smile immediately spreads across her face.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But I must confess that as of late, my thoughts have been wandering in a somewhat─”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, here comes another one.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nyoom.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Kotone instantly separates herself from me.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Well, even if I were not the Exalt-Priestess, I still ought not to cling to you in public.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Alright! Let us do as we promised and get back to work!”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Once the manager returns, Kotone and I retire to my room.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, we are finally alone. Just the two of us.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Aren't you tired from working the shop?”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nope, I am doing just fine!”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But it was terribly trying to have to hold myself back all this time.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Kotone murmurs, sidling up next to me.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Without saying another word, she slides her arms around me.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haaaahhh... I can finally cling to you without needing to worry about being seen!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nnmmhhh... Ehehee, Soujin-sama's scent...”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Kotone nuzzles her cheek against my neck like a kitten.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Practically entwining herself around me, she breathes in my scent and lets out a contented sigh.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You have noooo idea how long I have been holding myself back.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I wanted to act all lovey-dovey without concern for what others think, but I was forbidden on grounds that it would be unbecoming.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yet the more I held back, the more unbearable it became...”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"I wrap my own arms around her slender shoulders and hug her back.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That goes for the both of us.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Kotone's contented sighs tickle the back of my neck, slowly chipping away at my composure.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“They never once taught us at the seminary how joyful the embrace of a lover could be.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It'll be up to you to teach the next generation of priestesses that.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ehehee, you can count on me.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whenever I am consulted for romantic advice, I never fail to list off all the things I love about you as I extol the wonders of being in love.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Romantic advice?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, it is extremely popular among the junior priestesses.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As the Exalt-Priestess, not to mention a happily married missus, there could be no better personage to dispense sagely advice on all things romance!”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Kotone pulls apart from me to pridefully puff out her chest.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"The motion sets her large breasts swaying before my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My soliloquies about how wonderful you are never fail to draw a crowd, and being called the perfect couple is always music to my ears!”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Because of that, you are highly sought after among the priestesses.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I refuse to let anyone lay their hands on you, though!”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Kotone squeals and squirms with delight as she cups her cheeks with both her hands.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"But as realization finally dawns on me, unease begins to creep into her expression.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“D-Did I perhaps do anything untoward?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, I've just noticed a lot of the other priestesses staring at me recently. So it's all because of you, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Whenever I visit the Imperial Temple, the other priestesses would steal glances at me behind my back while whispering among themselves.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"I'd been wondering why they'd always blush and scurry away whenever I so much as made eye contact...",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I'm terribly sorry!”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ack!”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Misjudging her distance from me, her attempted bow only causes her to bonk her head against my chest.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Even that clumsiness of hers is so adorable.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, I'm hardly one to complain if my lover wants to talk me up.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh, what an unbefitting wife I have been...”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Kotone slumps her shoulders dejectedly.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"But she proceeds to nervously turn her gaze up towards me with an entreating expression.",
